    {
      "number": 4,
      "width": 594.95996,
      "height": 841.91998,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "4 / 6Onubot · Privacy Policy",
          "y": 28.170013906250006,
          "size": 7.994999516875006,
          "fonts": [
            "g_d1_f1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Device speech and platform services",
          "y": 772.9199828750002,
          "size": 10.994999391875005,
          "fonts": [
            "g_d1_f8"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Audio or read-aloud text may be handled by the speech engine you use, subject to",
          "y": 752.6699837187498,
          "size": 10.4999995625,
          "fonts": [
            "g_d1_f1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "device/provider settings.",
          "y": 736.16998440625,
          "size": 10.4999995625,
          "fonts": [
            "g_d1_f1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "7. Content standards: adult content is prohibited",
          "y": 697.9199859999999,
          "size": 13.4999994375,
          "fonts": [
            "g_d1_f5"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onubot does not allow adult-entertainment content, including pornography, erotic material,",
          "y": 674.66998696875,
          "size": 10.4999995625,
          "fonts": [
            "g_d1_f1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "sexually explicit content intended for sexual arousal, or sexual solicitation. Do not upload,",
          "y": 658.1699876562502,
          "size": 10.4999995625,
          "fonts": [
            "g_d1_f1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "request, create or share this material through messages, images, videos, documents or AI",
          "y": 642.4199883125002,
          "size": 10.4999995625,
          "fonts": [
            "g_d1_f1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "features. Sexual harassment, exploitation, non-consensual intimate content and any sexual",
          "y": 625.919989,
          "size": 10.4999995625,
          "fonts": [
            "g_d1_f1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "exploitation or abuse of children are strictly prohibited. Relevant, non-erotic questions about",
          "y": 609.4199896874998,
          "size": 10.4999995625,
          "fonts": [
            "g_d1_f1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "sexual or reproductive health and lawfully shared medical information are not adult",
          "y": 593.6699903437502,
          "size": 10.4999995625,
          "fonts": [
            "g_d1_f1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "entertainment; share only what is necessary for a legitimate healthcare purpose and respect",
          "y": 577.16999103125,
          "size": 10.4999995625,
          "fonts": [
            "g_d1_f1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "privacy and consent. Report prohibited content to admin@anchorblock.vc. Access may be",
          "y": 560.6699917187498,
          "size": 10.4999995625,
          "fonts": [
            "g_d1_f1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "restricted or content handled under the applicable terms and law.",
          "y": 544.9199923750002,
          "size": 10.4999995625,
          "fonts": [
            "g_d1_f1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "8. Permissions, background processing and local storage",
          "y": 505.91999399999986,
          "size": 13.4999994375,
          "fonts": [
            "g_d1_f5"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Camera permission supports image capture and consultations; microphone permission",
          "y": 483.4199949375002,
          "size": 10.4999995625,
          "fonts": [
            "g_d1_f1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "supports voice input and calls. File and photo pickers let you select uploads. Notifications",
          "y": 466.91999562499996,
          "size": 10.4999995625,
          "fonts": [
            "g_d1_f1",
            "g_d1_f7"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "support app alerts, which may reveal information on a lock screen. Internet access and",
          "y": 450.4199963125002,
          "size": 10.4999995625,
          "fonts": [
            "g_d1_f1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "foreground Data Sync services allow active chat or document work to continue while the app is",
          "y": 434.6699969687502,
          "size": 10.4999995625,
          "fonts": [
            "g_d1_f1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "minimized. The app does not include GPS walking tracking or calorie-estimation tracking,",
          "y": 418.16999765624996,
          "size": 10.4999995625,
          "fonts": [
            "g_d1_f1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "although IP-based technical information may indicate a general location. Settings, sessions and",
          "y": 401.6699983437502,
          "size": 10.4999995625,
          "fonts": [
            "g_d1_f1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "working copies may be cached on the device. Permission controls depend on the operating",
          "y": 385.9199990000002,
          "size": 10.4999995625,
          "fonts": [
            "g_d1_f1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "system; refusing a permission may limit the related feature.",
          "y": 369.41999968749997,
          "size": 10.4999995625,
          "fonts": [
            "g_d1_f1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "9. International processing",
          "y": 331.1700012812498,
          "size": 13.4999994375,
          "fonts": [
            "g_d1_f5"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cloud and communications providers may process information outside Bangladesh, including in",
          "y": 307.9200022499999,
          "size": 10.4999995625,
          "fonts": [
            "g_d1_f1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the United States and other service locations. The configured Langfuse service uses a United",
          "y": 291.42000293750016,
          "size": 10.4999995625,
          "fonts": [
            "g_d1_f1",
            "g_d1_f7"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "States endpoint. A global AI endpoint does not guarantee storage in a particular country.",
          "y": 275.67000359375015,
          "size": 10.4999995625,
          "fonts": [
            "g_d1_f1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Applicable transfer restrictions, contractual safeguards and any requirement to keep a local copy",
          "y": 259.17000428124993,
          "size": 10.4999995625,
          "fonts": [
            "g_d1_f1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "must be addressed before a transfer. Agreeing to this Policy does not waive mandatory",
          "y": 242.67000496875016,
          "size": 10.4999995625,
          "fonts": [
            "g_d1_f1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "protections for sensitive health information. Contact us for information about applicable",
          "y": 226.17000565624994,
          "size": 10.4999995625,
          "fonts": [
            "g_d1_f1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "processing locations and safeguards.",
          "y": 210.42000631249994,
          "size": 10.4999995625,
          "fonts": [
            "g_d1_f1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "10. Retention and deletion limits",
          "y": 171.42000793750003,
          "size": 13.4999994375,
          "fonts": [
            "g_d1_f5"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Information is retained for the stated service purpose and any applicable clinical, legal, security,",
          "y": 148.9200088749999,
          "size": 10.4999995625,
          "fonts": [
            "g_d1_f1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "financial or dispute-related need. A single retention period does not apply to every record.",
          "y": 132.42000956250013,
          "size": 10.4999995625,
          "fonts": [
            "g_d1_f7",
            "g_d1_f1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Account information may be needed while your account remains active; clinical records may",
          "y": 115.9200102499999,
          "size": 10.4999995625,
          "fonts": [
            "g_d1_f1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "require a different lawful period. Audio awaiting transcription, failed jobs, diagnostic logs and",
          "y": 100.1700109062499,
          "size": 10.4999995625,
          "fonts": [
            "g_d1_f1",
            "g_d1_f7"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Langfuse traces require separate retention and cleanup arrangements. Where backups exist,",
          "y": 83.67001159375013,
          "size": 10.4999995625,
          "fonts": [
            "g_d1_f1"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "number": 5,
      "width": 594.95996,
      "height": 841.91998,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "5 / 6Onubot · Privacy Policy",
          "y": 28.170013906250006,
          "size": 7.994999516875006,
          "fonts": [
            "g_d1_f1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "deletion may follow their rotation and legal requirements. No unestablished automatic deletion",
          "y": 772.9199828750002,
          "size": 10.4999995625,
          "fonts": [
            "g_d1_f1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "deadline is promised. Contact us for information about the retention arrangements that apply to",
          "y": 756.4199835625004,
          "size": 10.4999995625,
          "fonts": [
            "g_d1_f1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "your records.",
          "y": 740.6699842187504,
          "size": 10.4999995625,
          "fonts": [
            "g_d1_f1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "11. Your choices and privacy rights",
          "y": 701.66998584375,
          "size": 13.4999994375,
          "fonts": [
            "g_d1_f5"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Where applicable law provides these rights, you may request access, a copy, correction or",
          "y": 679.1699867812504,
          "size": 10.4999995625,
          "fonts": [
            "g_d1_f1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "deletion of your information, ask for processing to be restricted, object to processing, or",
          "y": 662.6699874687502,
          "size": 10.4999995625,
          "fonts": [
            "g_d1_f1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "withdraw consent for consent-based processing. Withdrawal does not undo earlier lawful",
          "y": 646.1699881562504,
          "size": 10.4999995625,
          "fonts": [
            "g_d1_f1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "processing and may make a related feature unavailable. You can adjust device permissions and",
          "y": 630.4199888125004,
          "size": 10.4999995625,
          "fonts": [
            "g_d1_f1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "notifications and use available profile or chat controls. Clearing a conversation does not",
          "y": 613.9199895000002,
          "size": 10.4999995625,
          "fonts": [
            "g_d1_f1",
            "g_d1_f7"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "necessarily remove consultation records, logs, provider traces or the account itself. Important",
          "y": 597.4199901875004,
          "size": 10.4999995625,
          "fonts": [
            "g_d1_f1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AI-assisted clinical information should be reviewed by a clinician rather than relied on as an",
          "y": 581.6699908437504,
          "size": 10.4999995625,
          "fonts": [
            "g_d1_f1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "automated decision.",
          "y": 565.1699915312502,
          "size": 10.4999995625,
          "fonts": [
            "g_d1_f1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "12. Requesting account or data deletion",
          "y": 526.1699931562503,
          "size": 13.4999994375,
          "fonts": [
            "g_d1_f5"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Email admin@anchorblock.vc with the subject \"Onubot account/data deletion\". Identify the",
          "y": 503.6699940937501,
          "size": 10.4999995625,
          "fonts": [
            "g_d1_f1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "account and specify the information you want deleted. Do not send passwords, OTPs, card PINs",
          "y": 487.16999478125035,
          "size": 10.4999995625,
          "fonts": [
            "g_d1_f1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "or unnecessary medical attachments. We may verify your identity or authority in a proportionate",
          "y": 470.66999546875013,
          "size": 10.4999995625,
          "fonts": [
            "g_d1_f1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "manner before acting. We will explain any lawful retention or limits, including records a clinician",
          "y": 454.9199961250001,
          "size": 10.4999995625,
          "fonts": [
            "g_d1_f1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "must independently retain and copies already shared or downloaded. Requests will be handled",
          "y": 438.41999681250036,
          "size": 10.4999995625,
          "fonts": [
            "g_d1_f1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "within applicable legal requirements. Signing out or uninstalling the app is not a deletion",
          "y": 421.91999750000014,
          "size": 10.4999995625,
          "fonts": [
            "g_d1_f1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "request. If an in-app deletion option is unavailable in your version of Onubot, use the email",
          "y": 406.16999815625013,
          "size": 10.4999995625,
          "fonts": [
            "g_d1_f1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "address above to request deletion.",
          "y": 389.66999884375036,
          "size": 10.4999995625,
          "fonts": [
            "g_d1_f1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "13. Children and another person’s health information",
          "y": 351.4200004375002,
          "size": 13.4999994375,
          "fonts": [
            "g_d1_f5"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Accounts are intended for adults aged 18 or over. An authorized parent, guardian or clinician",
          "y": 328.1700014062503,
          "size": 10.4999995625,
          "fonts": [
            "g_d1_f1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "may provide a child’s information for a lawful care purpose, subject to appropriate authority and",
          "y": 311.6700020937501,
          "size": 10.4999995625,
          "fonts": [
            "g_d1_f1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "consent. Permission to provide a child’s health information does not create an unrestricted",
          "y": 295.9200027500001,
          "size": 10.4999995625,
          "fonts": [
            "g_d1_f1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "independent child account. Do not submit another person’s confidential information without",
          "y": 279.4200034375003,
          "size": 10.4999995625,
          "fonts": [
            "g_d1_f1",
            "g_d1_f7"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "permission or another legal basis. Contact us if a child has registered independently or",
          "y": 262.9200041250001,
          "size": 10.4999995625,
          "fonts": [
            "g_d1_f1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "information was provided without the required authority. The adult-content prohibition in",
          "y": 247.1700047812501,
          "size": 10.4999995625,
          "fonts": [
            "g_d1_f1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "section 7 concerns prohibited material; it does not prohibit lawful adult users or legitimate",
          "y": 230.67000546875033,
          "size": 10.4999995625,
          "fonts": [
            "g_d1_f1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "healthcare questions.",
          "y": 214.1700061562501,
          "size": 10.4999995625,
          "fonts": [
            "g_d1_f1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "14. Security, advertising and purpose limits",
          "y": 175.92000775000042,
          "size": 13.4999994375,
          "fonts": [
            "g_d1_f5"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "We use authentication, account permissions and access controls to protect information. Some",
          "y": 152.67000871875052,
          "size": 10.4999995625,
          "fonts": [
            "g_d1_f1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "services must process readable content to provide AI, transcription or support. Do not assume",
          "y": 136.92000937500052,
          "size": 10.4999995625,
          "fonts": [
            "g_d1_f1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "that the entire service is end-to-end encrypted or that every local cache is encrypted. No system",
          "y": 120.4200100625003,
          "size": 10.4999995625,
          "fonts": [
            "g_d1_f1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "is completely secure. Report a suspected exposure to admin@anchorblock.vc; applicable breach-",
          "y": 103.92001075000053,
          "size": 10.4999995625,
          "fonts": [
            "g_d1_f1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "assessment and notification duties remain. This Policy does not authorize selling health",
          "y": 88.17001140625052,
          "size": 10.4999995625,
          "fonts": [
            "g_d1_f1",
            "g_d1_f7"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
