          "y": 662.6699874687497,
          "size": 10.4999995625,
          "fonts": [
            "g_d1_f1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "DOHS, Dhaka 1215, Bangladesh; email admin@anchorblock.vc or call +8801400655308. This",
          "y": 646.1699881562495,
          "size": 10.4999995625,
          "fonts": [
            "g_d1_f1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "does not prevent a complaint to a competent authority or another remedy available under",
          "y": 630.4199888124995,
          "size": 10.4999995625,
          "fonts": [
            "g_d1_f1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "applicable law. For medical emergencies, seek appropriate emergency medical care rather than",
